<title>GERMANY: Allianz Leben 96 premium income up 3.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Allianz Leben 96 premium income up 3.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>  Group premium income	    about 12,000  up 3.8 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Allianz Lebensversicherungs-AG, the life insurance unit of Allianz AG Holding. Allianz Leben also said new business grew strongly in 1996, with new premium income up 9.8 percent to 2.5 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
